    longDescription: `For 16 years, Kekuli Café has been trailblazing Canada’s café culture with something no other franchise offers: Bannock. Rooted in Indigenous tradition, Bannock is more than bread — it’s a story, a symbol of resilience, and the heart of our menu. From Bannock sandwiches and Tipi Tacos to PowWow Power Bowls and authentic smoothies, every bite connects customers to authentic Indigenous flavours while delivering the comfort of a modern café. We’re not just another coffee chain. We’re Canada’s first Indigenous fast‑casual café franchise, blending our very own Roasted espresso drinks, maple lattes, organic teas, and home‑style recipes with our own Pow “Wow” customer service program. Our slogan says it all: “Don’t Panic… We Have Bannock!” Customers, both locally and from all over the world, return not only for the food but also for the authentic Indigenous experience — warm, welcoming, and unforgettable. Entrepreneurs who join Kekuli Café aren’t just buying into a proven system with training and support. They’re building a legacy—a legacy of community, culture, and pride. Hundreds of franchises promise success. Only one offers profit with pride, purpose, and power. If you have the passion, we have the path. Please complete the fields below to contact us (* indicates a required field).`,
